cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "patccatClaims: Product vs Process U.S. Patent Claim Classifier"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Rule-based classifier that labels U.S. patent claims as product or process and
  extracts claim-structure flags (means-plus-function, Jepson, Beauregard,
  Markush, single-line, and others), operating over udpipe part-of-speech tags.
  It is the core classifier of the patccat pipeline, packaged for standalone use.
